# Finish every task clean

Before you tell the user the task is done:

1. Run lint and typecheck for each package you changed (`pnpm --filter <package> lint` and `pnpm --filter <package> typecheck`). Fix every error they report. Do not finish with a known lint or type failure.
2. If you changed behavior, routes, layout, data shape, tooling, or commands, update the matching file in `ai-knowledge/` and add one dated line to `ai-knowledge/log.md`.
3. Skip the knowledge update only when the task was a question, a review, or a change with no lasting project fact (formatting, a rename inside one function, a comment).

```bash
pnpm --filter @soulsync/web lint
pnpm --filter @soulsync/web typecheck
```

Use the package you actually touched. Details live in `ai-knowledge/quality.md`.
